From 8b9f21236908cc20c79f672a759f1b0fe7e36deb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 02:41:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD selected-agent slash execution so backend commands
 bypass prompt routing

Selected chat input that begins with a slash is treated as a provider command before the ordinary busy-session guard. Providers get default command hooks, while Codex handles status and fork through session state instead of resuming the agent thread.
